 In Ireland, hundreds of thousands of people died of hunger.

200
00:19:09,900 --> 00:19:12,740
 There was mass emigration from England to America and Australia.

201
00:19:13,290 --> 00:19:15,050
 France and Italy were on the edge of revolt.

202
00:19:15,050 --> 00:19:18,080
 In Switzerland, civil war followed national reforms.

203
00:19:18,650 --> 00:19:23,090
 The first Communist Congress was held in London, where Engel and Marx drew up the manifesto,

204
00:19:23,480 --> 00:19:25,360
 Workers of the World Unite.

205
00:19:46,090 --> 00:19:50,590
 1848, in France, Louis-Philippe's government still refuses any kind of reform.

206
00:19:53,790 --> 00:20:00,020
 The 23rd, 1848, another uprising in Paris.

207
00:20:22,200 --> 00:20:38,120
 He has abdicated and fled.

208
00:20:38,540 --> 00:20:39,980
 The Second Republic is proclaimed.

209
00:20:39,980 --> 00:20:43,280
 And together, citizens, we'll build a society that's equal and just.

210
00:20:46,720 --> 00:20:57,460
 The flag was red, but only as far as the Champs-Élysées and the flag tricolour has gone around the world

211
00:20:57,460 --> 00:20:59,700
 with the name, the glory, and the liberty of this country.

212
00:21:00,220 --> 00:21:15,960
 In about a few days, the spirit of revolt had spread abroad.

213
00:21:16,510 --> 00:21:21,230
 Countries of the German Empire, Baton, Hess, Nassau, Württemberg, Sachs, Hamburg, revolted.

214
00:21:21,660 --> 00:21:23,660
 The beginning of March, Austria's turn.

215
00:21:23,990 --> 00:21:26,160
 The Hungarians, the Czechs, demanded their liberty.

216
00:21:26,790 --> 00:21:30,290
 The 18th of March, uprisings in Milan, Venice, Palermo, Modena.

217
00:21:31,150 --> 00:21:33,920
 The same day in Berlin, the barricades go up.

218
00:21:34,520 --> 00:21:36,760
 The early spring of the people blossomed in Europe.

219
00:21:36,760 --> 00:21:39,930
 The emperor of Austria fled to the Tyrol.

220
00:21:40,660 --> 00:21:44,590
 But his army remained loyal, and this steamroller was soon to start moving.

221
00:21:45,770 --> 00:21:48,310
 17th of June, Prague is retaken.

222
00:21:49,150 --> 00:21:52,130
 25th of July, the army of Piedmont is defeated.

223
00:21:53,360 --> 00:21:56,680
 In August, with the help of the Russian army, they crush the Hungarian government.

224
00:21:57,700 --> 00:21:59,160
 In October, Vienna is taken.

225
00:22:00,640 --> 00:22:05,260
 In France, the government is made up of bourgeois who deplore socialism.

226
00:22:05,760 --> 00:22:10,360
 With the National Workshops affair, there was the outburst of working-class riots, crushed severely.

227
00:22:12,770 --> 00:22:17,730
