228
00:22:17,730 --> 00:22:20,170
 and the forces of law and order, leaving thousands dead.

229
00:22:20,630 --> 00:22:21,890
 Harsh reprisals followed.

230
00:22:21,890 --> 00:22:42,650
 Until then, we had the workers and the bourgeois on the same side of the barricade.

231
00:22:43,240 --> 00:22:44,220
 But that was over now.

232
00:22:49,840 --> 00:22:56,250
 The Constitution rejected the right to work, to education, to public welfare.

233
00:22:56,760 --> 00:22:59,500
 The people had once again been robbed of their right of dissent.

234
00:23:00,020 --> 00:23:00,530
 And why?

235
00:23:02,610 --> 00:23:07,260
 It happened only to the urban workers.

236
00:23:08,530 --> 00:23:11,170
 Terrified the peasant who elected the majority in the assembly.

237
