 I swear my loyalty to the Republic.

238
00:23:17,040 --> 00:23:22,300
 Furthermore, there was still a great antagonism between the different ethnic nations that were barely emerging.

239
00:23:23,220 --> 00:23:25,300
 But the seed had been sown.

240
00:23:40,810 --> 00:23:51,670
 Until tonight.

241
00:23:51,930 --> 00:23:52,610
 Don't be late.

242
00:23:52,610 --> 00:24:14,560
 The limit for trains was now 120 kilometers an hour.

243
00:24:35,400 --> 00:24:43,630
 There's no stopping the railway from progressing in giant leaps.

244
00:24:46,080 --> 00:24:49,100
