245
00:24:49,820 --> 00:24:53,960
 And the clever Cavour sends a female ambassador to plead for the independence of Italy.

246
00:24:55,650 --> 00:24:59,190
 The emperor, being a gallant man, would listen to her cause.

247
00:25:01,750 --> 00:25:05,010
