 Man or monkey?

249
00:25:07,770 --> 00:25:09,670
 The church was shocked by the alternative.

250
00:25:10,900 --> 00:25:14,210
 In 1859, Darwin publishes The Origin of the Species.

251
00:25:14,210 --> 00:25:15,830
 This time, there is a storm.

252
00:25:16,990 --> 00:25:20,350
 But your grandfather or your grandmother was the monkey manure, sir.

253
00:25:22,480 --> 00:25:26,630
 With the help of Napoleon III, Italy is liberated.

